        <h2>What this website provides</h2>
        <p>Every Real Estate Calculator provides free, browser-based calculators and educational explanations for real estate questions — payments, affordability, investment returns, commissions and taxes. The tools are provided for general information and planning.</p>

        <h2>Estimates, not advice</h2>
        <p>Every result is an estimate based on the figures you enter and the assumptions stated on the page. Results are not a lender quote, a valuation, an appraisal, or financial, tax or legal advice, and they do not guarantee any outcome. Tax and lending rules change and vary by location and by your circumstances. Verify important decisions with a qualified professional — a lender, a tax adviser, or an attorney — before acting on an estimate.</p>

        <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
        <p>You may use the calculators for your own personal or business planning. Do not attempt to disrupt the website, access it in a way that imposes an unreasonable load, or misrepresent its results as official figures from a lender, agency or authority.</p>

        <h2>External resources</h2>
        <p>Pages may link to official third-party sources (for example, IRS publications). Those sites are responsible for their own content; a link is a reference, not an endorsement of anything beyond the material cited.</p>

        <h2>Website content</h2>
        <p>The text, explanations and worked examples on this website were written for this website. You may link to any page and quote brief excerpts with credit and a link. Republication of substantial portions requires the operator's permission.</p>

        <h2>Availability</h2>
        <p>The website and any individual tool may change or be withdrawn at any time. RealtorCRM is a separate product; its availability and future pricing are described on its own page and in the application.</p>

        <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
        <p>These terms may be updated; the effective date above will change when they do. Continuing to use the website after an update means you accept the revised terms.</p>

